      "section": "Mathematics",
      "text": "If the equations <span class=\"math\">x<sup>2</sup> + ax + b = 0</span> and <span class=\"math\">x<sup>2</sup> + bx + a = 0</span> have a common root and <span class=\"math\">a ≠ b</span>, then the value of <span class=\"math\">a + b</span> is:",
